    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828280/extras/22faef8754df427fa04cb4e27757e391.poster.avif?t=1739824094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828280/extras/22faef8754df427fa04cb4e27757e391.webm?t=1739824094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828280/extras/22faef8754df427fa04cb4e27757e391.mp4?t=1739824094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Speed. Rhythm. Flow.</strong></h2>Infinity Girl is a fast-paced rhythm/racer/roguelite where everything \u2014 every action, every enemy and every spectacular world you encounter \u2014 is driven by the beat of the music. Each run is unique, with procedural levels that test your skills as you grind, drift, boost and leap to the rhythm. Get into a flow and blast through levels at incredible speeds, gaining game-changing abilities along the way. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828280/extras/e2c079aa0decf567f6dc418d8d2d6fea.poster.avif?t=1739824094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828280/extras/e2c079aa0decf567f6dc418d8d2d6fea.webm?t=1739824094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828280/extras/e2c079aa0decf567f6dc418d8d2d6fea.mp4?t=1739824094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tight, expressive controls tied to every beat<br></li><li> A hypnotic and procedurally generated electronic soundtrack<br></li><li> Vibrant cel-shaded art and surreal, music-driven visuals <br></li><li> Dodge obstacles and take down enemies that move to the rhythm<br></li><li> Powerful abilities and upgrades that transform every run<br></li><li> Pick up items that slow time, turn you into a wrecking ball or give you the power of flight<br></li><li> Challenge modes and achievements that reward mastery and make the game highly replayable<br></li><li> Race to The Orb\u2122 before time runs out (and this world is destroyed)</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828280/extras/07301f7d531d772a22cb155457975070.poster.avif?t=1739824094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828280/extras/07301f7d531d772a22cb155457975070.webm?t=1739824094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828280/extras/07301f7d531d772a22cb155457975070.mp4?t=1739824094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828280/extras/22faef8754df427fa04cb4e27757e391.poster.avif?t=1739824094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828280/extras/22faef8754df427fa04cb4e27757e391.webm?t=1739824094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828280/extras/22faef8754df427fa04cb4e27757e391.mp4?t=1739824094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Speed. Rhythm. Flow.</strong></h2>Infinity Girl is a fast-paced rhythm/racer/roguelite where everything \u2014 every action, every enemy and every spectacular world you encounter \u2014 is driven by the beat of the music. Each run is unique, with procedural levels that test your skills as you grind, drift, boost and leap to the rhythm. Get into a flow and blast through levels at incredible speeds, gaining game-changing abilities along the way. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828280/extras/e2c079aa0decf567f6dc418d8d2d6fea.poster.avif?t=1739824094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828280/extras/e2c079aa0decf567f6dc418d8d2d6fea.webm?t=1739824094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828280/extras/e2c079aa0decf567f6dc418d8d2d6fea.mp4?t=1739824094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tight, expressive controls tied to every beat<br></li><li> A hypnotic and procedurally generated electronic soundtrack<br></li><li> Vibrant cel-shaded art and surreal, music-driven visuals <br></li><li> Dodge obstacles and take down enemies that move to the rhythm<br></li><li> Powerful abilities and upgrades that transform every run<br></li><li> Pick up items that slow time, turn you into a wrecking ball or give you the power of flight<br></li><li> Challenge modes and achievements that reward mastery and make the game highly replayable<br></li><li> Race to The Orb\u2122 before time runs out (and this world is destroyed)</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828280/extras/07301f7d531d772a22cb155457975070.poster.avif?t=1739824094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828280/extras/07301f7d531d772a22cb155457975070.webm?t=1739824094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828280/extras/07301f7d531d772a22cb155457975070.mp4?t=1739824094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "Infinity Girl is a high-speed rhythm/racer/roguelite where everything \u2014 every action, every enemy and every spectacular world you encounter \u2014 is driven by the beat of the music. Each run is unique, with procedural levels that test your skills as you grind, drift, boost and leap to the rhythm.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cHoly sh** this is so sick. It's like hyper speed monkey ball on steroids.\u201d<br>William 'LordOvLoot' Pate<br><br>\u201cInfinity Girl is a mix between an endless runner, a roguelike, a racer, and a rhythm game all at once. Needless to say, this is a very ambitious project.\u201d<br>1Up Infinite<br>",
